2313
03:07:59,438 --> 03:08:05,284
Yes. You may have it back tomorrow with
interest; I am giving you a keynote.

2314
03:08:05,683 --> 03:08:11,290
The narrator records that Albert Wesker walked out
onto that stage the following morning,

2315
03:08:11,310 --> 03:08:16,790
