3135
04:15:09,166 --> 04:15:14,596
Or he could do the thing that the evidence actually
supported, which is what Owen Carrick

3136
04:15:14,616 --> 04:15:18,516
had been circling for four years without
letting himself see it.

3137
04:15:19,036 --> 04:15:20,806
(very soft) There's no crime.

3138
04:15:21,206 --> 04:15:22,595
There is no crime.

3139
04:15:22,995 --> 04:15:27,543
There are three hundred and eleven people in Newark
