3200
04:21:02,811 --> 04:21:05,199
of considerable personal courage.

3201
04:21:05,599 --> 04:21:11,344
Senator Grace Kowal of Michigan had spent nineteen
months building a case that a single

3202
04:21:11,364 --> 04:21:17,175
private company now held the medical reserves of nine
countries, the diagnostic capacity

3203
04:21:17,195 --> 04:21:22,807
of forty-one per cent of American clinical
laboratories, and a longevity therapy that

3204
04:21:22,827 --> 04:21:28,837
