4141
05:38:56,801 --> 05:38:58,162
(flat) They have.

4142
05:38:58,562 --> 05:39:04,388
He went to look at it on the third of January at
seven in the morning, in the cold, with

4143
05:39:04,408 --> 05:39:06,382
