4147
05:39:19,890 --> 05:39:25,722
They did not cheer. They did not present arms. They
stood, six thousand of them, and every

4148
05:39:25,742 --> 05:39:31,313
single one of them was looking at him, and none of
them blinked at the rate that human

4149
05:39:31,333 --> 05:39:32,158
