4151
05:39:35,135 --> 05:39:35,706
Don't.

4152
05:39:36,105 --> 05:39:43,834
I have been in your skull for thirteen years. I have
watched you refuse a parade in Lyon,

4153
05:39:43,854 --> 05:39:51,409
refuse a crowd in Basel, refuse to be carried
through a street by four hundred thousand

4154
05:39:51,429 --> 05:39:58,810
people. And here you are at seven in the morning in
a field with six thousand men who

4155
05:39:58,830 --> 05:40:06,385
