4157
05:40:07,797 --> 05:40:16,247
You did not want an audience. You wanted an *army*,
and you wanted to look at it alone.

4158
05:40:17,196 --> 05:40:23,412
Albert Wesker stood in the cold in a long black coat
and looked at the formation for a

4159
05:40:23,432 --> 05:40:27,836
