4161
05:40:33,765 --> 05:40:37,196
(flat) To protect Umbrella's people
and property, sir.

4162
05:40:37,596 --> 05:40:38,605
Mr. HUNK.

4163
05:40:39,005 --> 05:40:44,676
(radio) To make the use of force against Umbrella so
