4165
05:40:52,646 --> 05:40:55,846
We are not an army. We are a *price*.

4166
05:40:56,245 --> 05:41:02,529
The narrator notes that this was true in 2040 and
remained true for six years, and that

4167
05:41:02,549 --> 05:41:08,687
the six thousand became sixty thousand in 2044 and
