4181
05:42:15,818 --> 05:42:16,688
Yes.

4182
05:42:17,089 --> 05:42:19,259
That's not a system. That's a *hope*.

4183
05:42:19,658 --> 05:42:25,703
Wesker took the folder and read all nine pages
