4207
05:44:31,263 --> 05:44:34,493
General, may I show you something instead?

4208
05:44:34,892 --> 05:44:37,383
That's usually how these things go wrong.

4209
05:44:37,782 --> 05:44:41,873
Yes. Thursday. Bring whoever you like.

4210
05:44:42,272 --> 05:44:49,003
Eleven defence ministers came, and four chiefs of
