4235
05:46:57,850 --> 05:47:05,640
This is Officer Dray. She has been employed by
Umbrella for four years. In that time she

4236
05:47:05,660 --> 05:47:13,451
has not taken a day of sick leave, has not filed a
grievance, has not been late, and has

4237
05:47:13,471 --> 05:47:18,421
