told a thing twice.

4238
05:47:18,701 --> 05:47:25,230
She costs approximately nine per cent of what a
soldier of an equivalent standard costs

4239
05:47:25,250 --> 05:47:31,855
a national army over the same period, because she
does not require recruitment, does not

4240
05:47:31,875 --> 05:47:38,705
require retention, does not require a pension, does
not require a family support structure,

4241
05:47:38,725 --> 05:47:41,491
and cannot be lost to a better offer.

4242
05:47:42,100 --> 05:47:49,490
I am not selling her. I want to be extremely clear about
that, because eleven of the gentlemen

4243
05:47:49,510 --> 05:47:56,506
