4251
05:48:35,651 --> 05:48:39,021
He walked off the field. There were
no questions taken.

4252
05:48:39,420 --> 05:48:45,459
Officer Dray stood on that field for ninety minutes in
the rain while eleven defence ministers

4253
05:48:45,479 --> 05:48:50,938
