4255
05:48:53,980 --> 05:49:01,173
*DRAY, K. Acquired 2036, Security Cohort, Absolute.
Four years' service. No sick leave.

4256
05:49:01,193 --> 05:49:05,651
No grievance. No disciplinary
record. No leave taken.*

4257
05:49:06,050 --> 05:49:08,194
No leave taken. Four years.

4258
05:49:08,593 --> 05:49:14,483
Wesker read that file on the aircraft home and the
