4286
05:51:37,870 --> 05:51:42,117
The narrator will give you the consequences
in the order they arrived.

4287
05:51:42,517 --> 05:51:48,550
Within nine days, the share prices of the four
largest defence contractors in the United

4288
05:51:48,570 --> 05:51:54,672
States fell a combined thirty-one per cent, not
