4334
05:55:52,202 --> 05:55:58,205
been given fourteen years earlier in Trenton, and
which had by then become well enough

4335
05:55:58,225 --> 05:56:01,427
known in American business that
it had a name.

4336
05:56:01,826 --> 05:56:08,390
They called it *the Wilmington retirement.* It was
considered, by people who had watched

4337
05:56:08,410 --> 05:56:15,198
four decades of hostile takeovers, to be unusually
humane, and it was discussed in business

4338
05:56:15,218 --> 05:56:19,537
schools as evidence that Albert Wesker
was not vindictive.

4339
05:56:19,937 --> 05:56:26,465
The narrator would like to offer a second reading,
which is Carrick's, from a memorandum

4340
05:56:26,485 --> 05:56:28,847
of 2041 that was never answered:

4341
05:56:29,366 --> 05:56:35,852
He doesn't destroy the men he beats. He keeps them,
on salary, in a building he owns,

4342
05:56:35,872 --> 05:56:41,516
