Halvorsen, now Wyatt. Nine of them.

4343
05:56:41,797 --> 05:56:47,589
That isn't mercy. It's a *collection*. He is
assembling, one by one, every single person

4344
05:56:47,609 --> 05:56:53,467
who ever stood in front of him, and he is keeping
them where he can see them, comfortable

4345
05:56:53,487 --> 05:56:58,487
