4364
05:58:48,729 --> 05:58:55,129
It had one objective function, and Crane had
written it himself: *predict what Albert

4365
05:58:55,149 --> 05:58:56,489
Wesker does next.*

4366
05:58:56,888 --> 05:59:03,755
By February of 2042 it was right about sixty-one per
cent of the time on a four-week horizon,

4367
05:59:03,775 --> 05:59:10,567
which was considerably better than any human analyst,
any government, or any of the fourteen

4368
05:59:10,587 --> 05:59:13,899
hedge funds that had by then
given up trying.

4369
05:59:14,298 --> 05:59:21,219
It was also, by February of 2042, producing an
output that Crane had shown to exactly

4370
05:59:21,239 --> 05:59:22,198
four people.

4371
05:59:22,718 --> 05:59:24,069
It can't find the money.

4372
05:59:24,468 --> 05:59:29,078
He said it to his chief scientist, at two in
the morning, for the ninth time.

4373
05:59:29,599 --> 05:59:33,880
Every acquisition, every building, every plant — it
reconstructs the cash flows and they

4374
05:59:33,900 --> 05:59:38,132
don't close. Not by a little. By about four hundred
