4518
06:11:20,353 --> 06:11:23,233
I know. I wanted to see whether
you would use it.

4519
06:11:37,722 --> 06:11:44,502
The question of what Albert Wesker would do with a
hundred trillion dollars was answered

4520
06:11:44,522 --> 06:11:47,593
in 2043, and the answer was electricity.

4521
06:11:47,993 --> 06:11:53,445
The narrator wants to be exact about the sequence,
because it is the clearest example

4522
06:11:53,465 --> 06:11:59,045
in this account of the thing that made him
impossible to fight: he never took a market.

4523
06:11:59,065 --> 06:12:01,942
He *ended* one, and then owned
what was left.

4524
06:12:02,343 --> 06:12:08,417
Umbrella had acquired, in the Aegis wreckage, a
materials science division that had spent

4525
06:12:08,437 --> 06:12:14,443
nine years on plasma-facing components for a fusion
programme that the United States had

4526
06:12:14,463 --> 06:12:20,606
cancelled in 2038. The division had four hundred
engineers and one genuinely extraordinary

4527
06:12:20,626 --> 06:12:24,372
thing: a tungsten-lithium composite
that did not erode.

4528
06:12:24,773 --> 06:12:30,734
Every fusion programme on earth had the same
problem. Not the plasma — the plasma had

4529
06:12:30,754 --> 06:12:36,996
been solved, roughly, by 2036. The problem was that
the inside of the machine ate itself,

4530
06:12:37,016 --> 06:12:43,259
and every design on earth needed a rebuild every
eleven months, and no grid operator will

4531
06:12:43,279 --> 06:12:47,411
buy power from a plant that shuts down
every eleven months.

4532
06:12:47,811 --> 06:12:53,898
Birkin looked at the composite for six days and said
the thing that cost the petroleum

4533
06:12:53,918 --> 06:12:56,100
industry four trillion dollars.

4534
06:12:56,620 --> 06:13:01,508
It doesn't need to not erode. It needs to erode and
*regrow*. Albert, we have spent fifteen

4535
06:13:01,528 --> 06:13:06,255
years building organisms that lay down structure from
a template. This is a wall. A wall

4536
06:13:06,275 --> 06:13:08,090
is an easier problem than a liver.

4537
06:13:08,820 --> 06:13:14,310
You want to put a biological deposition
system inside a fusion reactor.

4538
06:13:14,710 --> 06:13:19,368
