They had captured everything. All thirty-one objectives,
in ninety minutes, with no casualties

5760
07:57:03,446 --> 07:57:09,132
on either side. They held the plants, the launch
complex, the Arcology, the ridge, the

5761
07:57:09,152 --> 07:57:15,169
ice, the island, and the man himself, who was sitting
in an office on the Arcology's fourth

5762
07:57:15,189 --> 07:57:20,476
level with a guard on the door and had asked only
for coffee and a pad of paper.

5763
07:57:20,876 --> 07:57:24,716
And by noon they had started to understand
what they were holding.

5764
07:57:25,237 --> 07:57:29,719
(flat) Sir, the Teraina desalination plant has gone
into a hold state. Not a fault — a

5765
07:57:29,739 --> 07:57:34,483
*hold*. The operators are sitting at their consoles.
They're polite, they answer questions,

5766
07:57:34,503 --> 07:57:37,467
they'll show you anything. They will
not start the plant.

5767
07:57:37,866 --> 07:57:39,797
Then have our people start it.

5768
07:57:40,196 --> 07:57:45,074
(flat) Our people are trying. The plant is asking for
an authorisation code from a management

5769
07:57:45,094 --> 07:57:49,550
system that only accepts instructions from
personnel it recognises, and the personnel

5770
07:57:49,570 --> 07:57:54,132
it recognises are the ones sitting at the consoles
refusing to give it, and they're not

5771
07:57:54,152 --> 07:57:58,609
refusing out of loyalty — I've had four interviews
now — they genuinely appear unable

5772
07:57:58,629 --> 07:57:58,766
to.

5773
07:57:59,377 --> 07:58:03,427
(flat) Sir, one of them cried. He wanted to do
it. He said he wanted to do it.

5774
07:58:03,827 --> 07:58:08,879
By the end of the first day there were eleven such
holds. By the end of the second there

5775
07:58:08,899 --> 07:58:09,917
were four hundred.

5776
07:58:10,317 --> 07:58:15,716
The narrator wants to be exact about the mechanism,
because every account since has got

5777
07:58:15,736 --> 07:58:17,646
it wrong in the same direction.

5778
07:58:18,047 --> 07:58:24,513
Albert Wesker did not order anybody to sabotage
anything. He had ordered the precise opposite:

5779
07:58:24,533 --> 07:58:30,378
*assist the visiting personnel with anything they
request*, in writing, in front of a

5780
07:58:30,398 --> 07:58:36,587
camera, and he had signed a second instrument at five
forty-one authorising every Absolute

5781
07:58:36,607 --> 07:58:41,486
employee to take instruction from the
officer commanding at their site.

5782
07:58:41,886 --> 07:58:47,460
And it did not work, and the reason it did not work
is the single most important fact

5783
07:58:47,480 --> 07:58:51,606
about the Absolute, and the Coalition
discovered it on day two.

5784
07:58:52,127 --> 07:58:54,496
Explain it to me again. Slowly.

5785
07:58:54,897 --> 07:59:01,563
They can take an instruction from you. They cannot
take *responsibility* from you. A man

5786
07:59:01,583 --> 07:59:08,554
who was made on a Saturday in 2039 with a wife and
seventeen years of memories is a complete

5787
07:59:08,574 --> 07:59:15,088
human being in every respect except one: he has
never in his life made a decision that

5788
07:59:15,108 --> 07:59:21,547
mattered on his own account, because there has
never been a moment when there was not

5789
07:59:21,567 --> 07:59:23,446
an instruction available.

5790
07:59:23,726 --> 07:59:30,482
You have removed the instruction. Not the giver of it
— I am still here, and I have signed

5791
07:59:30,502 --> 07:59:37,182
everything you have put in front of me — the
*structure*. They are not refusing you. They

5792
07:59:37,202 --> 07:59:43,580
are standing at their consoles in a condition that
your medical people are, I gather,

5793
07:59:43,600 --> 07:59:50,205
calling dissociative, and for which they have no
precedent, because there has never been

5794
07:59:50,225 --> 07:59:51,936
a population like this.

5795
07:59:52,337 --> 07:59:54,166
And you knew this would happen.

5796
07:59:54,567 --> 08:00:01,494
(very soft) I have known since 2027. It is in the
second panel I was ever shown. *Personnel

5797
08:00:01,514 --> 08:00:08,137
acquired through this interface cannot disobey.* I
understood on the first morning what

5798
08:00:08,157 --> 08:00:14,932
that would mean at scale and I built the scale
anyway, and I have had fifty years to find

5799
08:00:14,952 --> 08:00:17,756
a way out of it and there is not one.

5800
08:00:18,597 --> 08:00:20,426
Then why are you so calm?

5801
08:00:20,826 --> 08:00:27,048
Because you are about to learn the thing I learned
in 2033, Colonel, and it is going to

5802
08:00:27,068 --> 08:00:33,290
be a great deal worse for you than it was for me,
and there is nothing whatsoever I can

5803
08:00:33,310 --> 08:00:34,796
do to make it easier.

5804
08:00:35,196 --> 08:00:36,133
Which is?

5805
08:00:36,533 --> 08:00:43,123
(very soft) That there is no version of this in which
you give it back to somebody else.

5806
08:00:43,524 --> 08:00:47,374
The water ran out at Teraina on the
morning of the fifth day.

5807
08:00:47,774 --> 08:00:54,002
It ran out at four protectorates within the week, and
in every case the Coalition's engineers

5808
08:00:54,022 --> 08:00:59,780
had the plant running again inside thirty-six hours
by bypassing the management system

5809
08:00:59,800 --> 08:01:05,490
entirely, and in every case there was a gap, and in
the gap there were people with no

5810
08:01:05,510 --> 08:01:05,894
water.

5811
08:01:06,294 --> 08:01:12,268
Nobody died. The narrator wants that on the record,
because it was the closest thing to

5812
08:01:12,288 --> 08:01:18,331
a mass casualty in the entire affair and it did not
happen: the Coalition flew water in,

5813
08:01:18,351 --> 08:01:24,394
at enormous cost, with genuine competence and genuine
urgency, and four hundred thousand

5814
08:01:24,414 --> 08:01:29,424
people were inconvenienced and frightened and
not one of them was harmed.

5815
08:01:29,823 --> 08:01:36,383
But there is footage, from Teraina, on the fifth day, of
a queue of people at a dry standpipe.

5816
08:01:36,403 --> 08:01:42,473
And a Coalition press officer, doing her job,
explaining to a camera that the situation

5817
08:01:42,493 --> 08:01:47,093
was under control and that the water would
be restored by evening.

5818
08:01:47,493 --> 08:01:51,493
And behind her, in the queue, an old
woman looking at the camera.

5819
08:01:51,894 --> 08:01:57,916
That was the image. Not a massacre. A queue, and an
old woman's face, and a foreign officer

5820
08:01:57,936 --> 08:01:59,444
saying *under control*.

5821
08:01:59,844 --> 08:02:05,306
The demonstrations began on the sixth day, and they
were not organised by Umbrella, and

5822
08:02:05,326 --> 08:02:10,852
the narrator has checked this more carefully than
anything else in this account, because

5823
08:02:10,872 --> 08:02:14,634
it is the single most consequential
question of the century.

5824
08:02:15,034 --> 08:02:21,364
The Red Queen was in Coalition custody, powered down,
from the fourth of March. The asset

5825
08:02:21,384 --> 08:02:27,929
network of forty-one people in government and media,
purchased in 2034, was never activated;

5826
08:02:27,949 --> 08:02:34,136
the Coalition's own forensic review found it and
confirmed it had never once been used,

5827
08:02:34,156 --> 08:02:38,204
which was the most damaging finding
in the entire report.

5828
08:02:38,604 --> 08:02:44,270
What happened is simpler and worse. Four billion
people who took a free medicine every

5829
08:02:44,290 --> 08:02:49,957
sixteen weeks from a company that had never asked
them for anything watched a queue at

5830
08:02:49,977 --> 08:02:54,124
a dry standpipe, and made up their own
minds, and went outside.

5831
08:02:54,524 --> 08:03:01,204
Eleven million in Lagos. Nine million in Jakarta.
Four million in São Paulo, in Mexico

5832
08:03:01,224 --> 08:03:07,826
City, in Cairo, in Manila. In Europe and North
America it was smaller and angrier and

5833
08:03:07,846 --> 08:03:09,073
had more police.

5834
08:03:09,472 --> 08:03:16,012
The demand was four words, and it was on every sign
in nineteen languages, and it was

5835
08:03:16,032 --> 08:03:17,402
not *free Wesker*.

5836
08:03:17,801 --> 08:03:19,902
It was: *give us our doctor back.*

5837
08:03:20,301 --> 08:03:25,850
The Coalition held for eleven days, and the narrator
would like to say clearly that it

5838
08:03:25,870 --> 08:03:31,418
held for eleven days under conditions no government
in history has faced, and that the

5839
08:03:31,438 --> 08:03:33,813
people in that room were not cowards.

5840
08:03:34,214 --> 08:03:40,609
What broke it was not the protests. It was the
arithmetic, presented on day nine by the

5841
08:03:40,629 --> 08:03:45,108
same French analyst who had drawn the
dependency map in 2072.

5842
08:03:45,628 --> 08:03:47,898
Read the last paragraph aloud.

5843
08:03:48,298 --> 08:03:52,695
(flat) *We can operate the infrastructure. We
cannot operate the personnel. Restoring

5844
08:03:52,715 --> 08:03:57,528
full function requires either the replacement of
approximately four hundred thousand Absolute

5845
08:03:57,548 --> 08:04:01,997
employees with trained conventional staff — a
programme we estimate at seventeen years

5846
08:04:02,017 --> 08:04:06,518
and nine hundred billion dollars — or the
restoration of the command structure they are

5847
08:04:06,538 --> 08:04:07,402
contingent upon.*

5848
08:04:07,681 --> 08:04:12,499
(flat) *There is no third option. In the interim,
we estimate excess mortality across

5849
08:04:12,519 --> 08:04:17,450
the protectorates and the medical distribution
network at between four hundred thousand

5850
08:04:17,470 --> 08:04:22,287
and two million persons over twenty-four months,
depending on how quickly the Aeterna

5851
08:04:22,307 --> 08:04:23,311
network degrades.*

5852
08:04:24,262 --> 08:04:25,472
Two million.

5853
08:04:25,871 --> 08:04:28,801
(flat) At the upper bound. If we
hold for two years.

5854
08:04:29,202 --> 08:04:31,332
(very slow) And if we give it back?

5855
08:04:31,731 --> 08:04:36,432
(flat) Then nobody dies, sir, and he is exactly where
he was on the third of March, except

5856
08:04:36,452 --> 08:04:41,048
that eight billion people have now watched us try and
fail, and every government in this

5857
08:04:41,068 --> 08:04:45,717
room has demonstrated, on camera, that it will take
the water away from an island to make

5858
08:04:45,737 --> 08:04:47,081
a point about sovereignty.

5859
08:04:47,481 --> 08:04:53,963
The vote was on the fifteenth of March. Nine of the
twelve voted to withdraw. Two abstained.

5860
08:04:53,983 --> 08:04:57,851
One voted to continue and its
government fell in April.

5861
08:04:58,250 --> 08:05:03,758
On the ninth day the French colonel came back, off
duty, without his camera, which was

5862
08:05:03,778 --> 08:05:09,543
a court-martial offence, and sat on a chair in a room
where the most powerful man on earth

5863
08:05:09,563 --> 08:05:14,170
was being held with a guard on the door and
four books he had asked for.

5864
08:05:14,691 --> 08:05:20,364
I have three thousand people on this platform and I
cannot get the water plant at Teraina

5865
08:05:20,384 --> 08:05:26,057
to start, and a girl at that plant has been sitting
at a console for six days apologising

5866
08:05:26,077 --> 08:05:26,441
to me.

5867
08:05:26,721 --> 08:05:31,915
You have not asked me for anything in nine days. Not
a lawyer, not a telephone. You have

5868
08:05:31,935 --> 08:05:33,160
asked for four books.

5869
08:05:33,560 --> 08:05:34,830
I have read them.

5870
08:05:35,231 --> 08:05:36,941
Why are you not fighting me?

5871
08:05:37,890 --> 08:05:41,241
(very soft) Colonel, what do
you think I am?

5872
08:05:41,640 --> 08:05:44,951
Nine days ago I would have said a man
with a private army.

5873
08:05:45,351 --> 08:05:46,461
And now?

5874
08:05:46,861 --> 08:05:51,902
Now I think you are the only piece of infrastructure in
this building that cannot be seized,

5875
08:05:51,922 --> 08:05:56,909
and that you have known it for about fifty years, and
that you have spent nine days letting

5876
08:05:56,929 --> 08:05:59,770
my government find it out at the
cost of some water.

5877
08:06:00,611 --> 08:06:05,813
(very cold) That is very close to correct and there
is one thing in it that is wrong,

5878
08:06:05,833 --> 08:06:11,220
and I would like to give it to you because you have
been decent to my people and because

5879
08:06:11,240 --> 08:06:12,941
you will be blamed for this.

5880
08:06:13,221 --> 08:06:20,804
I did not let you find it out. I have been trying
to explain it since 2034 and nobody

5881
08:06:20,824 --> 08:06:28,407
has been able to hear it, because it is not a
threat and it cannot be drawn on a map.

5882
08:06:28,427 --> 08:06:36,815
*There is no mechanism by which this can be handed to
anybody.* Not to you, not to a tribunal,

5883
08:06:36,835 --> 08:06:44,507
not to the United Nations. I did not build it that
way to keep it. I built it that way

5884
08:06:44,527 --> 08:06:52,111
because in 2026 it was faster, and I have been
unable to undo it for fifty-one years.

5885
08:06:52,390 --> 08:06:58,776
(very cold) You were right to come. Your governments
were right. The only thing anybody

5886
08:06:58,796 --> 08:07:01,721
got wrong was believing there was a key.

5887
08:07:02,121 --> 08:07:08,697
Colonel Émile Roux was retired in 2078 at his own
request, having declined to give evidence

5888
08:07:08,717 --> 08:07:15,076
to the Coalition's inquiry on the grounds that he had
gone off duty to a detainee's room

5889
08:07:15,096 --> 08:07:16,670
without authorisation.

5890
08:07:17,071 --> 08:07:23,724
He is the sole named source for that conversation.
He published it in 2091, four pages,

5891
08:07:23,744 --> 08:07:30,321
in a memoir that sold badly, and its last line is
the epigraph of the Hangzhou Accord.

5892
08:07:30,841 --> 08:07:34,171
We went to take the keys and found the
locks had been grown.

5893
08:07:34,571 --> 08:07:40,155
They released him at six o'clock in the morning on
the sixteenth of March, eleven days

5894
08:07:40,175 --> 08:07:46,084
and two hours after they had taken him, and they did
it without any ceremony at all because

5895
08:07:46,104 --> 08:07:48,887
nobody had any idea how to do
it with some.

5896
08:07:49,286 --> 08:07:54,716
He walked out onto the causeway in the same coat, in
front of four hundred thousand people

5897
08:07:54,736 --> 08:07:59,862
who had been told at midnight that he was coming
out, and who had been standing there

5898
08:07:59,882 --> 08:08:00,830
since about two.

5899
08:08:01,231 --> 08:08:06,701
The narrator will describe the next ninety seconds
as precisely as the record allows.

5900
08:08:07,101 --> 08:08:13,185
He stopped. He looked at the crowd for a long moment.
And he raised one hand, flat, palm

5901
08:08:13,205 --> 08:08:19,080
out — not a wave; the gesture a man makes to a room
that is about to start shouting —

5902
08:08:19,100 --> 08:08:23,659
and four hundred thousand people went
quiet in about four seconds.

5903
08:08:24,178 --> 08:08:25,548
Nobody died.

5904
08:08:26,377 --> 08:08:32,483
I want that to be the first sentence, and I want it
to be the one you remember, because

5905
08:08:32,503 --> 08:08:38,538
in about an hour there will be four hundred people
telling you what this was, and most

5906
08:08:38,558 --> 08:08:40,087
of them will be wrong.

5907
08:08:40,367 --> 08:08:47,552
Twelve governments believed that no species should
depend on the goodwill of one man.

5908
08:08:47,572 --> 08:08:54,926
They were right. They have been right since 2034,
when I said so myself, under oath, in

5909
08:08:54,946 --> 08:09:01,537
front of a Senate committee, and asked them to
build something better than me.

5910
08:09:01,818 --> 08:09:08,102
(very cold) They did not build it. They came to take
it instead, and they took it without

5911
08:09:08,122 --> 08:09:14,266
hurting anyone, and then they discovered what I have
known since I was forty years old:

5912
08:09:14,286 --> 08:09:20,358
that the thing they were taking cannot be held by
anybody else, because I built it out

5913
08:09:20,378 --> 08:09:23,688
of people who cannot be given to
another owner.

5914
08:09:24,408 --> 08:09:32,135
That is my fault. Not theirs. Mine. I built it that
way because it was faster, and because

5915
08:09:32,155 --> 08:09:39,624
it worked, and because every year for fifty years
the alternative would have cost lives

5916
08:09:39,644 --> 08:09:45,478
that I could count and the risk would have
been a thing I could not.

5917
08:09:45,757 --> 08:09:52,811
Go home. Drink something. The water is on everywhere
as of four o'clock this morning and

5918
08:09:52,831 --> 08:09:56,267
the medicine did not stop for
a single day.

5919
08:09:56,668 --> 08:10:02,696
He did not say anything else. He did not smile, or
thank anybody, or raise a fist, and

5920
08:10:02,716 --> 08:10:08,674
when they began to chant his name anyway he stood
there until it stopped, and it took

5921
08:10:08,694 --> 08:10:09,517
a long time.

5922
08:10:10,668 --> 08:10:19,219
Event: the Eleven Days. Twelve Coalition states, all
withdrawn. Deaths, all causes, attributable:

5923
08:10:19,239 --> 08:10:26,819
zero. Global sentiment: ninety-six per cent
favourable, the highest figure I have ever

5924
08:10:26,839 --> 08:10:34,419
recorded. Forty billion Points. Note: you did not
defend yourself. You have never been

5925
08:10:34,439 --> 08:10:35,214
stronger.

5926
08:10:35,805 --> 08:10:41,517
And in a cell of an office on the fourth level, on
the eleventh night, Owen Carrick —

5927
08:10:41,537 --> 08:10:47,315
who had been detained with the rest of the
Directorate and had spent the entire eleven

5928
08:10:47,335 --> 08:10:53,114
days refusing to speak to his own former colleagues
from the Bureau — wrote the eighth

5929
08:10:53,134 --> 08:10:56,215
folder on hotel notepaper, and
it is one line.

5930
08:10:56,736 --> 08:11:02,486
He let them take it so that they would find out it
cannot be taken. That is not a defence.

5931
08:11:17,875 --> 08:11:24,886
Wen Shulan was ninety-nine years old in 2077. She had
retired from the Ministry of State

5932
08:11:24,906 --> 08:11:31,756
Security in 2061, had taken Aeterna in 2065 at the
insistence of her daughter, and had

5933
08:11:31,776 --> 08:11:38,867
spent sixteen years in a house outside Hangzhou
writing a history that she did not intend

5934
08:11:38,887 --> 08:11:39,745
to publish.

5935
08:11:40,146 --> 08:11:45,785
She had not been consulted about the Coalition. Her
country had not joined it; that had

5936
08:11:45,805 --> 08:11:51,705
been her doing, from retirement, in four conversations
over two years, and it is the reason

5937
08:11:51,725 --> 08:11:55,804
China was one of the two abstentions on
the fifteenth of March.

5938
08:11:56,204 --> 08:12:02,500
In September Albert Wesker came to see her, and it
was the fifth time they had met in

5939
08:12:02,520 --> 08:12:03,689
forty-one years.

5940
08:12:04,210 --> 08:12:06,239
You look precisely the same.

5941
08:12:06,640 --> 08:12:09,729
You look better than in 2036.

5942
08:12:10,130 --> 08:12:16,177
I am better than in 2036. That is your doing and I
have never thanked you for it and I

5943
08:12:16,197 --> 08:12:17,800
do not intend to start.

5944
08:12:18,199 --> 08:12:24,235
She poured tea. The narrator notes that neither of
them had said anything about the Eleven

5945
08:12:24,255 --> 08:12:29,146
Days for four minutes, which was, for both of
them, a form of politeness.

5946
08:12:29,666 --> 08:12:31,506
They should not have done it.

5947
08:12:31,907 --> 08:12:33,257
They were right to do it.

5948
08:12:33,657 --> 08:12:39,594
Both of those are true, which is the whole
difficulty. I told four ministers in 2073 that

5949
08:12:39,614 --> 08:12:45,417
it would fail and that the failure would make him
unassailable, and I was told I was an

5950
08:12:45,437 --> 08:12:49,567
old woman who had been compromised by a
personal relationship.

5951
08:12:50,176 --> 08:12:55,308
I was an old woman who had watched you for forty-one
years and had noticed that you have

5952
08:12:55,328 --> 08:13:00,517
never once been beaten by anyone who came at you
directly, and that on the four occasions

5953
08:13:00,537 --> 08:13:04,147
you were beaten it was by someone who
asked you for something.

5954
08:13:04,547 --> 08:13:05,997
She put the pot down.

5955
08:13:06,517 --> 08:13:09,107
So I am going to ask you for something.

5956
08:13:09,506 --> 08:13:15,824
What Wen Shulan proposed on the eleventh of
September 2077 became, after two years and

5957
08:13:15,844 --> 08:13:22,088
four months of negotiation, the Hangzhou Accord,
and the narrator will give it to you

5958
08:13:22,108 --> 08:13:24,447
in the four clauses that matter.

5959
08:13:24,846 --> 08:13:30,717
One. The Umbrella Directorate is recognised, by
every signatory, as a legal person in

5960
08:13:30,737 --> 08:13:36,607
international law with the capacity to hold
territory, conclude treaties and be sued.

5961
08:13:36,627 --> 08:13:42,706
Not a state. A new category, and the argument about
what to call it lasted eleven months

5962
08:13:42,726 --> 08:13:45,616
and was settled with the word *Authority*.

5963
08:13:46,017 --> 08:13:52,344
Two. Umbrella's core functions — medicine, energy,
water, the strategic reserves — are

5964
08:13:52,364 --> 08:13:59,060
placed under a standing obligation of supply. It may
not withhold them from any population,

5965
08:13:59,080 --> 08:14:05,555
for any reason, ever. The obligation is enforceable
in a tribunal that Umbrella does not

5966
08:14:05,575 --> 08:14:07,327
appoint and cannot veto.

5967
08:14:07,727 --> 08:14:14,103
Three. Every Umbrella territory retains the right to
leave, by referendum, on two years'

5968
08:14:14,123 --> 08:14:19,336
notice, and the signatories guarantee the
independence of any that does.

5969
08:14:19,737 --> 08:14:26,248
Four — and this is Wen's clause, the one she wrote
herself in a garden in Hangzhou, and

5970
08:14:26,268 --> 08:14:30,526
the one that Albert Wesker argued
about for nine months —

5971
08:14:31,045 --> 08:14:36,962
The Authority shall maintain no capacity to compel
the obedience of any human being by

5972
08:14:36,982 --> 08:14:43,313
means that the person cannot perceive, refuse or
report. Existing personnel in that category

5973
08:14:43,333 --> 08:14:47,455
shall be enumerated, registered, and
progressively released.

5974
08:14:48,406 --> 08:14:52,376
(very cold) You are asking me to
give up the Absolute.

5975
08:14:52,775 --> 08:14:58,540
I am asking you to stop *making* them, and to let the
four hundred thousand you have made

5976
08:14:58,560 --> 08:15:00,685
go, over whatever period is safe.

5977
08:15:01,085 --> 08:15:07,864
Half of them will not survive it. You have read the
Coalition's own analysis; you know

5978
08:15:07,884 --> 08:15:14,979
what happened at Teraina in eleven days. These are not
slaves I can free with a signature.

5979
08:15:14,999 --> 08:15:22,014
They are people who have never once in their lives
held their own reins, and some of them

5980
08:15:22,034 --> 08:15:23,595
are forty years old.

5981
08:15:23,995 --> 08:15:29,414
I know. That is why the clause says *progressively*,
and why there is no deadline in it,

5982
08:15:29,434 --> 08:15:32,566
and why I have given you the right
to set the pace.

5983
08:15:33,285 --> 08:15:38,254
(very slow) Albert. I have watched you for forty-one
years, and in all that time there

5984
08:15:38,274 --> 08:15:43,359
is exactly one thing you have built that I would call
evil, and it is not the virus, and

5985
08:15:43,379 --> 08:15:47,129
it is not the soldiers, and it is not the
monster in the stadium.

5986
08:15:47,410 --> 08:15:52,842
It is that you solved the oldest problem of power —
that people can say no to you — and

5987
08:15:52,862 --> 08:15:57,980
you solved it so completely that you have
forgotten it was a problem worth having.

5988
08:15:58,381 --> 08:16:04,764
The narrator will record that Albert Wesker did not
answer for a long time, and that what

5989
08:16:04,784 --> 08:16:07,210
he finally said was not agreement.

5990
08:16:07,730 --> 08:16:13,898
(very soft) If I sign that clause, I will spend
forty years dismantling the thing that

5991
08:16:13,918 --> 08:16:20,157
made all of it possible, and there is a real chance
that it kills a great many of them,

5992
08:16:20,177 --> 08:16:26,489
and the only reason I would do it is that a
ninety-nine-year-old woman in a garden asked

5993
08:16:26,509 --> 08:16:26,920
me to.

5994
08:16:27,321 --> 08:16:28,282
Yes.

5995
08:16:28,681 --> 08:16:30,771
That is a very poor reason.

5996
08:16:31,171 --> 08:16:37,067
It is the only kind of reason anybody has ever had.
You have been waiting since 2026 for

5997
08:16:37,087 --> 08:16:42,983
somebody to be able to make you do something. Nobody
can. So it will have to be somebody

5998
08:16:43,003 --> 08:16:43,656
you *let*.

5999
08:16:44,715 --> 08:16:51,368
He signed it in Hangzhou on the fourth of January
2080, with forty-one signatory states,

6000
08:16:51,388 --> 08:16:53,946
in a room with four cameras in it.

6001
08:16:54,345 --> 08:17:00,451
The Registry's letter went to four hundred and eleven
thousand people over thirty years,

6002
08:17:00,471 --> 08:17:06,576
in the order in which their cohorts came up, and the
narrator has read the fourth draft,

6003
08:17:06,596 --> 08:17:12,771
which is the one that was used, and which Albert
Wesker wrote himself in 2081 and rewrote

6004
08:17:12,791 --> 08:17:13,607
three times.

6005
08:17:14,006 --> 08:17:20,050
It is nine paragraphs. It does not apologise, which
was the most argued-about decision

6006
08:17:20,070 --> 08:17:22,306
in the Directorate for a decade.

6007
08:17:22,706 --> 08:17:28,421
It says: that the recipient was placed into the world
on a specific date, which is given;

6008
08:17:28,441 --> 08:17:33,898
that their memories before that date were provided
rather than lived; that everything

6009
08:17:33,918 --> 08:17:39,440
since is entirely their own; that the people in
their life are real and their feelings

6010
08:17:39,460 --> 08:17:45,561
for them are real; that they are, in law and in every
way the Directorate is able to determine,

6011
08:17:45,581 --> 08:17:51,232
a person; that they have never been able to refuse an
instruction from Umbrella and that

6012
08:17:51,252 --> 08:17:56,967
this will end on a date, which is given; that they
are entitled to see every record about

6013
08:17:56,987 --> 08:18:02,508
themselves, and to compensation, and to leave with a
pension at any time; and that the

6014
08:18:02,528 --> 08:18:08,436
man responsible is named, and is alive, and will answer
any letter they send him personally.

6015
08:18:08,837 --> 08:18:11,157
About sixty-one thousand of them wrote.

6016
08:18:11,556 --> 08:18:17,752
He answered all sixty-one thousand, over
thirty-nine years, in longhand, at a rate of

6017
08:18:17,772 --> 08:18:24,041
about nine a week, and the archive of those replies
is four hundred volumes and is the

6018
08:18:24,061 --> 08:18:26,454
other reason this account exists.

6019
08:18:26,854 --> 08:18:33,008
Ray Dorsey — the plant supervisor from Chapter Four,
who had telephoned his wife on his

6020
08:18:33,028 --> 08:18:39,464
first Monday and told her he had been doing this for
twenty-seven years — was in the second

6021
08:18:39,484 --> 08:18:42,445
cohort, at the age of fifty-five, in 2082.

6022
08:18:42,845 --> 08:18:46,495
He wrote four lines. The reply is
in volume nine.

6023
08:18:47,015 --> 08:18:51,845
*I don't want compensation and I don't want to leave.
I want to know one thing. The holiday

6024
08:18:51,865 --> 08:18:53,445
in Ocean City. Did it happen?*

6025
08:18:53,845 --> 08:19:01,788
*Mr. Dorsey. No. It did not happen, and I am sorry to
be the one to confirm it. You were

6026
08:19:01,808 --> 08:19:09,479
given it complete, including the rain on the
Thursday, on the eighth of January 2027,

6027
08:19:09,499 --> 08:19:17,442
because a system I do not fully understand decided
that a man of your age would have had

6028
08:19:17,462 --> 08:19:17,895
one.*

6029
08:19:18,174 --> 08:19:24,547
*I have thought about your question for some days. I
think the honest answer is that the

6030
08:19:24,567 --> 08:19:30,793
holiday is the only thing in your life that is not
yours, and that everything you have

6031
08:19:30,813 --> 08:19:36,604
done with your wife since that Monday is, and
that there is rather a lot of it.*

6032
08:19:36,885 --> 08:19:44,883
(very slow) *You are entitled to be angry with me
and I will read anything further you

6033
08:19:44,903 --> 08:19:46,655
send. — A. Wesker.*

6034
08:19:47,055 --> 08:19:52,942
Ray Dorsey took his wife to Ocean City in the
spring of 2083. He wrote once more, two

6035
08:19:52,962 --> 08:19:58,988
lines, and the reply in volume nine is one line, and
the narrator will not print either

6036
08:19:59,008 --> 08:20:04,895
of them, because there are four hundred volumes of
this and some of it belongs to the

6037
08:20:04,915 --> 08:20:06,285
people who wrote it.

6038
08:20:06,685 --> 08:20:11,561
The enumeration took four years. Four hundred
and eleven thousand names.

6039
08:20:11,960 --> 08:20:17,879
The release programme took the rest of the century
and is not finished at the end of this

6040
08:20:17,899 --> 08:20:23,818
account. The narrator will give you its shape,
because it is the only thing Albert Wesker

6041
08:20:23,838 --> 08:20:29,557
ever did that he did badly, and he did it badly for
twenty-seven years before it began

6042
08:20:29,577 --> 08:20:30,091
to work.

6043
08:20:30,490 --> 08:20:36,686
The first cohort was nine hundred volunteers at
Raccoon City in 2081: Absolute personnel

6044
08:20:36,706 --> 08:20:42,690
in non-critical roles, released in the only way
anyone could think of, which was that

6045
08:20:42,710 --> 08:20:48,694
Wesker issued a final instruction saying *from this
date you will take no instruction

6046
08:20:48,714 --> 08:20:54,980
from me or from anyone in my name*, and then the
Directorate waited to see what happened.

6047
08:20:55,380 --> 08:21:01,162
Fourteen of the nine hundred could not tolerate it.
The narrator will not describe what

6048
08:21:01,182 --> 08:21:07,097
that means; the medical literature calls it terminal
executive vacancy and there are four

6049
08:21:07,117 --> 08:21:09,830
papers about it and all of them are grim.

6050
08:21:10,230 --> 08:21:16,388
The other eight hundred and eighty-six were, within
