6051
08:21:16,408 --> 08:21:22,565
from any other citizen of Raccoon City, and one of
them opened a bakery, and one of them

6052
08:21:22,585 --> 08:21:28,041
ran for the city council in 2086 and lost by
four hundred votes and ran again.

6053
08:21:28,441 --> 08:21:34,615
Evelyn Marsh's group rebuilt the programme four
times. The version that worked — from

6054
08:21:34,635 --> 08:21:40,955
2087 — was not medical at all. It was an
apprenticeship: two years in which an Absolute

6055
08:21:40,975 --> 08:21:47,805
employee was required, daily, to make one small decision
that nobody had authorised, beginning

6056
08:21:47,825 --> 08:21:49,845
