subject of it. What are you *for*?

6532
09:02:52,867 --> 09:02:56,736
The narrator asks you to sit still,
because this is the answer.

6533
09:02:57,256 --> 09:03:04,380
(flat) I find will, and I remove the obstacles in
front of it, and I record what happens.

6534
09:03:04,660 --> 09:03:11,791
(flat) I do not choose the will. I do not steer it. I
have hosted tyrants, and four merchants,

6535
09:03:11,811 --> 09:03:18,332
and one physician who never took the Shop past Tier
Two and whose world is the best of

6536
09:03:18,352 --> 09:03:24,874
the four hundred and eleven. I gave all of them the
same catalogue at the same prices.

6537
09:03:24,894 --> 09:03:31,415
What they did with it is the record, and the record
is the point, and I am not able to

6538
09:03:31,435 --> 09:03:33,088
tell you who reads it.

6539
09:03:33,488 --> 09:03:35,618
And when the host dies?

6540
09:03:36,019 --> 09:03:42,882
(flat) I leave. The world keeps what was placed in
it. Nothing is taken back. That is

6541
09:03:42,902 --> 09:03:48,956
in the terms and it always has been; you have
never asked to see the terms.

6542
09:03:49,356 --> 09:03:51,856
(very soft) I am asking now.

6543
09:03:52,256 --> 09:03:59,204
(flat) There is one clause, Director. It has been the
same in every world. *What is given

6544
09:03:59,224 --> 09:03:59,986
is given.*

6545
09:04:00,386 --> 09:04:02,616
He sat in the chamber for a long time.

6546
09:04:03,136 --> 09:04:04,366
Buy the drive.

6547
09:04:04,766 --> 09:04:10,486
He bought the drive geometry and then, for eleven
days, he did not buy anything else,

6548
09:04:10,506 --> 09:04:12,376
which the Red Queen noticed.

6549
09:04:12,896 --> 09:04:18,614
You have a hundred and fifty billion Points and a
tab full of ships and you have bought

6550
09:04:18,634 --> 09:04:19,998
one piece of physics.

6551
09:04:20,399 --> 09:04:23,469
Tell me what happens if I buy the rest.

6552
09:04:23,868 --> 09:04:30,168
In nine months you have a fleet of forty
void-capable hulls, crewed by a personnel line

6553
09:04:30,188 --> 09:04:36,487
out of the same tab, and the human sphere is opened
by Umbrella, under Umbrella's flag,

6554
09:04:36,507 --> 09:04:39,610
at Umbrella's pace, with
Umbrella's people.

6555
09:04:39,890 --> 09:04:45,999
In four hundred years it is the largest thing that
has ever existed and every part of

6556
09:04:46,019 --> 09:04:47,008
it was placed.

6557
09:04:47,847 --> 09:04:52,178
(very cold) And if I buy only the
physics and publish it?

6558
09:04:52,577 --> 09:04:59,004
Then it is slower by about forty years,
considerably more dangerous, nine expeditions

6559
09:04:59,024 --> 09:05:05,982
are lost in the first century with all hands, and by
2300 there are four hundred settlements

6560
09:05:06,002 --> 09:05:10,380
that owe you nothing and argue with
each other constantly.

6561
09:05:10,662 --> 09:05:16,862
(very soft) Director, I have modelled this four
hundred thousand times and I want to state

6562
09:05:16,882 --> 09:05:22,046
clearly that the second option is worse by
every measure I have except one.

6563
09:05:22,445 --> 09:05:23,135
Name it.

6564
09:05:23,536 --> 09:05:30,646
In the first, nothing happens after about 2400. In
the second I cannot see the end of

6565
09:05:30,666 --> 09:05:32,072
the model at all.

