is the one thing nobody argued about

6766
09:22:46,042 --> 09:22:46,471
enough.

6767
09:22:46,752 --> 09:22:51,842
To the people who built the spars twice: thank you,
and I am sorry about the four months.

6768
09:22:52,122 --> 09:22:57,107
To the Assembly: we are not a colony of anywhere. We
are eleven hundred people who have

6769
09:22:57,127 --> 09:23:02,228
gone somewhere, and when we arrive we will decide
what we are, and you will find out with

6770
09:23:02,248 --> 09:23:03,091
everybody else.

6771
09:23:03,372 --> 09:23:08,021
(very slow) To the First Director, who is listening and
who did not come to the dock because

6772
09:23:08,041 --> 09:23:12,538
he thought it would make the day about him, and who
was right: we built it. Not you. That

6773
09:23:12,558 --> 09:23:16,802
is the whole of the message and you know exactly
what it cost you to let it be true.

6774
09:23:17,752 --> 09:23:23,528
He had watched it from a window on Dock One, four
kilometres away, with the Red Queen

6775
09:23:23,548 --> 09:23:24,142
relaying.

6776
09:23:24,661 --> 09:23:26,579
You could have gone to the dock.

6777
09:23:26,978 --> 09:23:32,907
There were eleven hundred people saying goodbye to
their families. The addition of the

6778
09:23:32,927 --> 09:23:36,988
oldest man alive would have made the
photographs about him.

6779
09:23:37,388 --> 09:23:43,165
That is what she said you would say. She wagered four
hundred credits with her chief engineer.

6780
09:23:44,004 --> 09:23:45,914
(very soft) Did she win?

6781
09:23:46,315 --> 09:23:47,843
She did, Director.

6782
09:23:48,873 --> 09:23:55,517
Vessel: Christina. Constructed, not placed. Four
million one hundred and ten thousand

6783
09:23:55,537 --> 09:24:02,808
human welds. Crew of eleven hundred. Drive operational.
Points expended: seventy-one billion.

6784
09:24:02,828 --> 09:24:09,708
Points that would have been required to place it
finished: forty billion. Note: you have

6785
09:24:09,728 --> 09:24:16,529
paid thirty-one billion Points for the privilege of
having built something. This is the

6786
09:24:16,549 --> 09:24:23,036
first time in four hundred and eleven worlds that
I have recorded that transaction.

6787
09:24:23,627 --> 09:24:25,077
Was it a good trade?

6788
09:24:25,916 --> 09:24:28,306
(flat) I do not evaluate.

6789
09:24:28,706 --> 09:24:31,257
I know. Answer anyway.

6790
09:24:32,316 --> 09:24:39,057
(flat) The physician I mentioned, in the world that
is the best of the four hundred and

6791
09:24:39,077 --> 09:24:45,740
eleven. She never bought a facility. She built nine
clinics with her own hands and her

6792
09:24:45,760 --> 09:24:52,346
own money over forty years and spent her Points on
medicine that she gave away, and I

6793
09:24:52,366 --> 09:24:59,106
closed that world at Tier Two with a host who died
at eighty-one of something ordinary.

6794
09:24:59,387 --> 09:25:06,737
(flat) I have thought about her four hundred million
times, Director, which is not a figure

6795
09:25:06,757 --> 09:25:12,488
of speech, and it is the closest thing to an
evaluation that I possess.

6796
09:25:12,887 --> 09:25:18,911
The narrator notes that this is the last exchange
between Albert Wesker and the System

6797
09:25:18,931 --> 09:25:24,884
recorded in this Part, that the *Christina* left
Dock One on the fourth of March 2092

6798
09:25:24,904 --> 09:25:31,208
with eleven hundred people aboard and Mira Halder on
the bridge, and that it was the first

6799
09:25:31,228 --> 09:25:36,337
object made by human hands to leave the solar
system under its own power.

6800
09:25:49,958 --> 09:25:54,940
They were not looking for us. That is the first
thing, and the whole of the next fifty

6801
09:25:54,960 --> 09:25:55,988
years turns on it.

6802
09:25:56,387 --> 09:26:02,170
The Tollhouse Compact is a trading association of
nineteen species, about four thousand

6803
09:26:02,190 --> 09:26:07,839
years old, that operates on a principle so simple
it took human diplomats a decade to

6804
09:26:07,859 --> 09:26:13,708
believe it: *a market is cheaper than a war, always,
at every scale, without exception.*

6805
09:26:13,728 --> 09:26:19,777
It has no military. It has never held territory. It
has been extinguished twice and rebuilt

6806
09:26:19,797 --> 09:26:22,378
both times by the people who missed it.

6807
09:26:22,778 --> 09:26:29,606
In August of 2103 a Compact survey vessel, on a route
it had flown for nine hundred years,

6808
09:26:29,626 --> 09:26:36,302
detected something that had not been there on the
previous pass: four hundred and eleven

6809
09:26:36,322 --> 09:26:42,923
artificial objects in a system that had been
catalogued as *pre-contact, industrial, no

6810
09:26:42,943 --> 09:26:43,608
traffic.*

6811
09:26:44,007 --> 09:26:50,203
The Compact's rules for that situation are four
thousand years old and take up eleven

6812
09:26:50,223 --> 09:26:56,418
words. *Approach slowly, transmit continuously,
offer first, and never arrive armed.*

6813
09:26:56,817 --> 09:27:02,776
The broker's name has nine syllables and the human
record renders it as Ashet. It came

6814
09:27:02,796 --> 09:27:08,823
aboard Dock One alone, unarmed, in a translucent
envelope of its own atmosphere, and it

6815
09:27:08,843 --> 09:27:14,940
brought — because the Compact's protocol requires a
gift and because four thousand years

6816
09:27:14,960 --> 09:27:21,196
of practice have made them extremely good at choosing
one — a functioning cure for a human

6817
09:27:21,216 --> 09:27:21,753
disease.

6818
09:27:22,152 --> 09:27:28,527
Not a cure the Compact had developed. A cure it had
synthesised in eleven days from broadcast

6819
09:27:28,547 --> 09:27:34,577
medical literature it had intercepted on the
approach, for a rare neurological condition

6820
09:27:34,597 --> 09:27:40,559
that Umbrella's own people had failed to crack for
forty years, and that affected about

6821
09:27:40,579 --> 09:27:42,003
nine thousand people.

6822
09:27:42,402 --> 09:27:47,469
The narrator notes that this was a deliberate
choice: not a cure for something large,

6823
09:27:47,489 --> 09:27:52,556
which would have looked like a demonstration of
power, but for something small, which

6824
09:27:52,576 --> 09:27:53,992
looked like *attention*.

6825
09:27:54,513 --> 09:27:56,662
You are the authority here.

6826
09:27:57,062 --> 09:28:03,497
I am an authority here. There are four hundred and
eleven others and you will meet nine

6827
09:28:03,517 --> 09:28:04,832
of them this week.

6828
09:28:05,233 --> 09:28:07,983
That is not what your own people say.

6829
09:28:08,383 --> 09:28:15,652
No. It is what our constitutional instruments say,
and I have spent twenty years making

6830
09:28:15,672 --> 09:28:21,432
the two converge, and you have arrived in
the middle of the argument.

6831
09:28:21,833 --> 09:28:29,356
Ashet's report to the Compact, which was published in
the human record in 2119, contains

6832
09:28:29,376 --> 09:28:35,442
a line that four generations of human
historians have found unbearable.

6833
09:28:35,962 --> 09:28:41,233
*The subject's species appears to be governed by a
single individual who is actively attempting

6834
09:28:41,253 --> 09:28:46,244
to reduce his own authority and has been doing so,
unsuccessfully, for approximately forty

6835
09:28:46,264 --> 09:28:50,978
years. I have not encountered this configuration
before. I recommend extreme caution:

6836
09:28:50,998 --> 09:28:55,432
a power that is trying to give itself away is the
most difficult kind to price.*

6837
09:28:55,833 --> 09:29:01,654
The negotiation lasted four months and the narrator
will give you the shape of it, because

6838
09:29:01,674 --> 09:29:07,365
it is the last time in this account that Albert
Wesker is the second most powerful thing

6839
09:29:07,385 --> 09:29:09,182
in the room and he knows it.

6840
09:29:09,583 --> 09:29:15,722
The Compact wanted three things: a trade station in
the system, most-favoured terms on

6841
09:29:15,742 --> 09:29:21,881
human biological science — which was, they said
without embarrassment, the finest they

6842
09:29:21,901 --> 09:29:28,113
had encountered in nine hundred years — and an
undertaking that humanity would not arm.

6843
09:29:28,513 --> 09:29:34,570
That last one was not a threat. It was a *sales
pitch*. The Compact's entire proposition,

6844
09:29:34,590 --> 09:29:41,125
four thousand years refined, is that a species which does
not arm gets the Compact's protection,

6845
09:29:41,145 --> 09:29:47,134
and the protection has held nineteen times in four
thousand years, and the two occasions

6846
09:29:47,155 --> 09:29:50,002
it failed are in every Compact schoolroom.

6847
09:29:50,522 --> 09:29:55,417
You have four kilometre hulls. You have a drive that
we did not sell you and that your

6848
09:29:55,437 --> 09:30:00,504
physics did not produce. You have an organism in cold
storage at your ninth facility that

6849
09:30:00,524 --> 09:30:02,333
I will not discuss in this room.

6850
09:30:02,612 --> 09:30:07,853
We are not asking you to disarm. We are asking you to
stop, at the point you have reached,

6851
09:30:07,873 --> 09:30:12,821
in exchange for four thousand years of accumulated
reasons why every species that did

6852
09:30:12,841 --> 09:30:15,042
not stop is a ruin that we trade over.

6853
09:30:15,883 --> 09:30:18,553
(very cold) And if we decline?

6854
09:30:18,953 --> 09:30:23,608
Then nothing whatsoever happens, Director. That is
the part your people keep failing to

6855
09:30:23,628 --> 09:30:28,391
hear. We do not punish. We simply do not shelter, and
in about ninety years the Veth will

6856
09:30:28,411 --> 09:30:32,583
arrive, and you will discover what that means
without us standing between you.

6857
09:30:32,982 --> 09:30:34,683
He accepted two of the three.

6858
09:30:35,083 --> 09:30:41,254
The trade station was placed at the fourth Lagrange
point in 2104 and is still there.

6859
09:30:41,274 --> 09:30:48,174
The science agreement made Umbrella, within a decade,
the largest single exporter of biological

6860
09:30:48,194 --> 09:30:54,875
knowledge in nine hundred light years, and the narrator
notes that it also gave five species

6861
09:30:54,895 --> 09:31:00,193
access to Aeterna and that the Compact's own
actuaries had to be rebuilt.

6862
09:31:00,592 --> 09:31:02,022
He declined the third.

6863
09:31:02,542 --> 09:31:09,688
I am not going to promise that my species will not arm,
because I am not entitled to promise

6864
09:31:09,708 --> 09:31:17,010
it. There are seven billion human beings, four hundred
thousand of them in the Free Territory,

6865
09:31:17,030 --> 09:31:23,864
and about nine hundred of them build ships in orbit,
and I have spent forty years making

6866
09:31:23,884 --> 09:31:26,513
it possible for them to refuse me.

6867
09:31:26,792 --> 09:31:33,603
You are asking me to use an authority that I have
been trying to dismantle, in order to

6868
09:31:33,623 --> 09:31:39,962
guarantee something for four hundred years, on
behalf of people who are not born.

6869
09:31:40,573 --> 09:31:47,591
(very cold) You have been talking to me for four
months. Tell me honestly: is that a refusal,

6870
09:31:47,611 --> 09:31:52,662
or is it the only trustworthy answer you
have had from this system?

6871
09:31:53,063 --> 09:32:00,650
Ashet's reply was eleven words and it is carved, in
Compact script and in nine human languages,

6872
09:32:00,670 --> 09:32:03,293
on the wall of the station at L4.

6873
09:32:03,813 --> 09:32:07,283
It is the first answer I have not
had to discount.

6874
09:32:07,683 --> 09:32:13,690
The narrator will spend a page on what the Compact
actually did to humanity, because every

6875
09:32:13,710 --> 09:32:19,517
account concentrates on the Veth and the Choir and
the wars, and the thing that changed

6876
09:32:19,537 --> 09:32:21,393
people's lives was a market.

6877
09:32:21,792 --> 09:32:29,097
The station opened in 2104 with nineteen species
trading on it. By 2107 there were four

6878
09:32:29,117 --> 09:32:36,421
hundred human businesses on it, of which three
hundred and eleven were not Umbrella and

6879
09:32:36,441 --> 09:32:40,294
eleven were one person with a
cargo allowance.

6880
09:32:40,693 --> 09:32:46,790
What humanity sold: biological science, which the
Compact considered the best in nine

6881
09:32:46,810 --> 09:32:52,979
hundred light years; music, which nobody had
expected and which four species developed

6882
09:32:52,999 --> 09:32:59,384
an expensive habit for; and — this is the part every
human schoolchild learns — argument.

6883
09:32:59,904 --> 09:33:04,992
You will not understand this and I have stopped trying
to explain it politely. Your species

6884
09:33:05,012 --> 09:33:09,764
produces disagreement of a quality we have not
encountered. Not conflict. Conflict is

6885
09:33:09,784 --> 09:33:14,647
common and cheap. *Formal structured disagreement*,
conducted in public, by parties who

6886
09:33:14,667 --> 09:33:17,174
continue to trade with each
other afterwards.

6887
09:33:17,453 --> 09:33:22,620
There are five species in the Compact who have paid,
in hard trade credit, to have human

6888
09:33:22,640 --> 09:33:27,630
advocates argue their disputes. We have nothing
like it. Our disputes are resolved by

6889
09:33:27,650 --> 09:33:27,984
price.

6890
09:33:28,383 --> 09:33:36,150
The Compact's archive at L4 contains four thousand
years of trade law and, in a wing added

6891
09:33:36,170 --> 09:33:44,283
in 2111, the complete proceedings of the Human Assembly,
translated, updated weekly, consulted

6892
09:33:44,303 --> 09:33:45,668
by nine species.

6893
09:33:46,068 --> 09:33:52,820
Umbrella earned nothing from it. It had no part in
it. Albert Wesker read the Compact's

6894
09:33:52,840 --> 09:33:59,515
assessment of it in 2112 and, according to the Red
Queen's log, read it four times and

6895
09:33:59,535 --> 09:34:02,007
then sat for twenty-two minutes.

6896
09:34:02,407 --> 09:34:08,454
The narrator will now cover thirty-seven years in a
page, because this is a story about

6897
09:34:08,474 --> 09:34:13,337
one man and because for thirty-seven years
the story is not about him.

6898
09:34:13,736 --> 09:34:19,750
Humanity went out. Not in an exodus and not in an
empire: in about four hundred separate

6899
09:34:19,770 --> 09:34:25,784
attempts, most of them badly funded, nine of which
failed with loss of life, and fifteen

6900
09:34:25,804 --> 09:34:27,567
of which became something.

6901
09:34:27,967 --> 09:34:33,955
The *Christina* made landfall in 2098 at a system the
catalogue calls Kiln and its people

6902
09:34:33,975 --> 09:34:39,761
call, for reasons that involve a joke about a
welder, Ochoa. Mira Halder was its first

6903
09:34:39,781 --> 09:34:45,702
elected administrator, and resigned after one term
because she said the job should never

6904
09:34:45,722 --> 09:34:51,846
be held by the person who built the place, and then
spent forty years building other things

6905
09:34:51,866 --> 09:34:54,817
and arguing with the people who
did hold it.

6906
09:34:55,217 --> 09:35:01,487
Raccoon City sent nine thousand people. The Arcology
sent forty thousand, which was ten

6907
09:35:01,507 --> 09:35:08,067
per cent of its population, and the Tuesday problem in
the Free Territory — the consequence

6908
09:35:08,087 --> 09:35:14,430
deficit, the four-times suicide rate — fell by two
thirds inside a generation and nobody

6909
09:35:14,450 --> 09:35:16,526
has ever entirely agreed why.

6910
09:35:16,927 --> 09:35:23,305
The Progenitor lineage went out too. There were about
four hundred of them by 2110: Evelyn

6911
09:35:23,325 --> 09:35:29,704
Marsh's family and the families of the eleven people
she had, after nine years of argument

6912
09:35:29,724 --> 09:35:36,529
with the Directorate and the Hangzhou tribunal, been
permitted to offer it to. Mira Reiss-Marsh,

6913
09:35:36,549 --> 09:35:42,643
who was twenty-one, went to Ochoa on the second wave
and did not tell anybody what she

6914
09:35:42,663 --> 09:35:44,137
was for eleven years.

6915
09:35:44,536 --> 09:35:46,256
And Umbrella stopped growing.

6916
09:35:47,406 --> 09:35:54,281
Umbrella, audit. Nineteen territories. Nine million
four hundred thousand people under

6917
09:35:54,301 --> 09:36:01,577
administration, out of a human sphere of twenty-seven
point nine billion. Umbrella's share:

6918
09:36:01,597 --> 09:36:08,872
nought point nought nine per cent, and falling. One
hundred and forty-one thousand Absolute

6919
09:36:08,892 --> 09:36:15,927
personnel remaining; the release programme is at
sixty-six per cent. Four million Points

6920
09:36:15,947 --> 09:36:18,813
this quarter, the lowest since 2029.

6921
09:36:19,404 --> 09:36:21,974
The lowest since 2029.

6922
09:36:22,374 --> 09:36:23,500
(flat) Yes.

6923
09:36:23,900 --> 09:36:25,590
Am I doing badly?

6924
09:36:26,539 --> 09:36:33,482
(flat) You are doing something I have no measure
for. Your species is growing at a rate

6925
09:36:33,502 --> 09:36:40,604
that has no precedent in my record. Your organisation
is shrinking, deliberately, at your

6926
09:36:40,624 --> 09:36:47,487
own instruction. I pay for consequence and the
consequence is enormous and almost none

6927
09:36:47,507 --> 09:36:50,127
of it is now attributable to you.

6928
09:36:50,409 --> 09:36:57,876
(flat) In four hundred and eleven worlds, no host
has ever run this experiment. I would

6929
09:36:57,896 --> 09:36:59,942
like to see how it ends.

6930
09:37:00,342 --> 09:37:07,269
The narrator notes that in 2141 the Veth Hegemony
arrived thirty-nine years ahead of the

6931
09:37:07,289 --> 09:37:13,032
Compact's estimate, and that it did not find
a single man with an empire.

6932
09:37:13,432 --> 09:37:19,833
It found seven billion people spread across four
hundred worlds who had spent forty years

6933
09:37:19,853 --> 09:37:25,966
learning how to argue, and one very old thing in a
black coat standing quietly at the

6934
09:37:41,215 --> 09:37:47,220
The Veth Hegemony is older than the oceans of Earth.
It has four hundred thousand worlds,

6935
09:37:47,240 --> 09:37:52,974
a caste structure that has not changed in nine
hundred thousand years, and a founding

6936
09:37:52,994 --> 09:37:58,526
doctrine that the human record translates,
imperfectly, as *the settled question.*

6937
09:37:58,926 --> 09:38:04,765
The settled question is this: every species that
reaches the void either submits to an

6938
09:38:04,785 --> 09:38:10,898
order or imposes one, and the Veth reached the void
first, and therefore the order exists,

6939
09:38:10,918 --> 09:38:16,962
and therefore submission is not a defeat but an
administrative formality that has already

6940
09:38:16,982 --> 09:38:20,233
taken place and merely needs to
be acknowledged.

6941
09:38:20,632 --> 09:38:26,465
They have annexed eleven hundred species. They have
fought four wars in ninety thousand

6942
09:38:26,485 --> 09:38:28,214
years. The wars are short.

6943
09:38:28,614 --> 09:38:35,939
They arrived at Ochoa — a human colony of nine
hundred thousand people, forty-three years

6944
09:38:35,959 --> 09:38:43,202
old, with a dock, two ships and a hydroponic economy
— on the fourth of April 2141, with

6945
09:38:43,222 --> 09:38:46,504
thirteen vessels, and they did not fire.

6946
09:38:47,024 --> 09:38:54,292
You are informed. The system is within the settled
order. Your administration continues.

6947
09:38:54,312 --> 09:39:01,912
Your production is assessed at one part in nine. Your
vessels will be registered. A garrison

6948
09:39:01,932 --> 09:39:04,645
will arrive in four hundred days.

6949
09:39:05,047 --> 09:39:10,972
The colony's administrator — a woman of sixty-one
named Theresa Okonkwo-Vance, who had

6950
09:39:10,992 --> 09:39:16,987
been elected eight months earlier on a platform
about water rights — asked the question

6951
09:39:17,007 --> 09:39:22,656
that every annexed species has asked and that the
Veth have a standard answer for.

6952
09:39:23,176 --> 09:39:24,786
And if we decline?

6953
09:39:25,187 --> 09:39:32,269
Then the system is within the settled order, your
administration does not continue, and

6954
09:39:32,289 --> 09:39:35,535
a garrison arrives in four hundred days.

6955
09:39:35,935 --> 09:39:42,019
She transmitted the exchange to Earth and to every
human world, in the clear, unencrypted,

6956
09:39:42,039 --> 09:39:47,785
within the hour, which was not in any protocol and
which is the reason the next fifty

6957
09:39:47,805 --> 09:39:49,685
years went the way they did.

6958
09:39:50,085 --> 09:39:55,989
Nine hundred and eleven human settlements received
it inside four months. By the time

6959
09:39:56,009 --> 09:40:02,402
it reached Earth the argument had already been running
for a third of a year on four hundred

6960
09:40:02,422 --> 09:40:06,375
worlds, in public, and Albert Wesker
had not said a word.

6961
09:40:06,775 --> 09:40:13,219
The narrator wants to describe the body that decided
this, because it did not exist in

6962
09:40:13,239 --> 09:40:19,758
2091 and because building it is the only thing
Albert Wesker ever did that he could not

6963
09:40:19,778 --> 09:40:20,584
do quickly.

6964
09:40:20,984 --> 09:40:27,082
The Human Assembly had four hundred and eleven seats,
elected from the worlds by population,

6965
09:40:27,102 --> 09:40:33,066
meeting on Earth and by relay. It had existed for
nineteen years. It controlled the shared

6966
09:40:33,086 --> 09:40:38,785
defence budget, the Compact treaties, the drive
registry and the Progenitor protocols,

6967
09:40:38,805 --> 09:40:44,836
and it had no executive at all: the Directorate
implemented what it voted, and the Hangzhou

