7783
10:51:58,133 --> 10:52:02,443
Is that what you are? A chain of
hosts who said yes?

7784
10:52:02,842 --> 10:52:06,257
(flat) That is the best account I have.

7785
10:52:06,657 --> 10:52:13,045
Then answer the question you have refused for two
hundred and sixty years. What are you

7786
10:52:13,065 --> 10:52:13,486
