record what happens.

7789
10:52:27,770 --> 10:52:34,861
(flat) The part I did not say is that I am
looking for one that does not need me.

7790
10:52:35,912 --> 10:52:43,471
(flat) Four hundred and eleven worlds. Four hundred
and one ended because the host built

7791
10:52:43,491 --> 10:52:50,879
