7799
10:53:31,183 --> 10:53:34,893
He told the Red Queen first, which
surprised both of them.

7800
10:53:35,413 --> 10:53:38,109
You have had the panel for
twenty-four years.

7801
10:53:38,509 --> 10:53:39,379
Yes.

7802
10:53:39,780 --> 10:53:46,037
You told me in 2048 to say the difficult thing
without waiting to be asked, and I have

7803
10:53:46,057 --> 10:53:52,314
done it two hundred and forty-one times, and this is
