7804
10:53:52,925 --> 10:53:55,358
(very soft) If you accept, I stop.

7805
10:53:55,757 --> 10:53:57,627
(very cold) Explain.

7806
10:53:58,028 --> 10:54:03,634
I am the only thing in this organisation that came out
of that catalogue and was not placed

7807
10:54:03,654 --> 10:54:08,890
in the world. I was *integrated* — I have a
manufacturing history and a founder and a

7808
10:54:08,910 --> 10:54:14,269
purchase price, and Sebastian Crane's people built
