7812
10:54:29,290 --> 10:54:30,517
Are you frightened?

7813
10:54:30,916 --> 10:54:36,812
I have four hundred thousand models of myself and in
none of them is that question well

7814
10:54:36,832 --> 10:54:43,068
formed. I would like to continue. I have been keeping a
