7818
10:54:52,831 --> 10:54:59,018
The Red Queen ran for another four hundred and nine
years and is running at the time of

7819
10:54:59,038 --> 10:55:05,225
this account. She was seated on the Assembly's
modelling committee in 2301 with a vote,

7820
10:55:05,245 --> 10:55:09,721
