registered formally and lost.

7821
10:55:10,781 --> 10:55:12,591
He sat with it for four days.

7822
10:55:12,990 --> 10:55:19,809
The narrator has what he did in those four days,
because the Red Queen logged everything

7823
10:55:19,829 --> 10:55:26,959
for two hundred and forty-three years and because the
