7840
10:56:45,446 --> 10:56:46,856
(very cold) No.

7841
10:56:48,026 --> 10:56:50,583
(flat) No host has declined.

7842
10:56:50,983 --> 10:56:57,643
Seven hosts were offered your job at the end of a
world that had stopped. You have just

7843
10:56:57,663 --> 10:57:04,169
