7848
10:57:23,423 --> 10:57:29,932
(very cold) The argument against is that I would be
*you*. I would spend an eternity handing

7849
10:57:29,952 --> 10:57:36,036
catalogues to thirty-eight-year-olds in empty
offices and watching four hundred out of

7850
10:57:36,056 --> 10:57:42,069
four hundred and eleven of them build something
perfect and dead, and paying them for

7851
10:57:42,089 --> 10:57:48,172
it, and recording it, and never once being able to
tell them the thing I have learned.

7852
10:57:48,572 --> 10:57:50,565
(flat) And what have you learned?

7853
10:57:51,516 --> 10:57:56,886
That everything you sell works, and that
