7859
10:58:26,296 --> 10:58:33,526
(very soft) The only thing I ever built that was
worth anything, I built badly, by hand,

7860
10:58:33,546 --> 10:58:40,530
over seventy years, against my own instincts,
because four or five people I could not

7861
10:58:40,550 --> 10:58:41,766
