7864
10:58:57,216 --> 10:58:58,225
Declined.

7865
10:58:59,466 --> 10:59:01,451
(flat) Then I will leave.

7866
10:59:01,850 --> 10:59:02,701
I know.

7867
10:59:03,100 --> 10:59:10,309
(flat) Nothing is taken back. That has always been
in the terms. The cities stay. The

7868
10:59:10,329 --> 10:59:17,197
