7874
10:59:40,956 --> 10:59:45,127
That is the fourth time in two
hundred and sixty years.

7875
10:59:45,527 --> 10:59:48,619
(flat) Yes. I have counted them too.

7876
10:59:49,678 --> 10:59:55,729
The narrator will give you the last exchange exactly
