7880
11:00:08,389 --> 11:00:09,839
Was I a good one?

7881
11:00:11,009 --> 11:00:13,399
(flat) I do not evaluate.

7882
11:00:14,229 --> 11:00:15,625
(flat) I price.

7883
11:00:16,345 --> 11:00:24,131
(flat) Four hundred and ten worlds and I have never
