7885
11:00:26,785 --> 11:00:31,793
Termination. Interface withdrawn.
What is given is given.

7886
11:00:33,153 --> 11:00:39,169
At six o'clock in the morning on the eighteenth of
September 2286, in a corner office

7887
11:00:39,189 --> 11:00:45,347
on the sixth floor of a building that had appeared
out of nothing two hundred and sixty

7888
11:00:45,367 --> 11:00:47,832
years earlier, the panels went out.

7889
11:00:48,232 --> 11:00:54,598
There is no record of what Albert Wesker did for the
following hour, because for the following

7890
11:00:54,618 --> 11:01:00,440
hour there was, for the first time since he was
thirty-eight years old, nothing in the

7891
11:01:13,042 --> 11:01:14,293
He did not die.

7892
11:01:14,692 --> 11:01:20,363
The narrator will deal with that immediately, because
two hundred years of popular accounts

7893
11:01:20,383 --> 11:01:23,302
have made a mystery of it and
