7897
11:01:40,821 --> 11:01:46,552
a very good hospital could match. He aged, from that
morning, at approximately one year

7898
11:01:46,572 --> 11:01:47,212
in ninety.

7899
11:01:47,612 --> 11:01:53,504
He was two hundred and sixty years old and had
become, in the space of about a minute,

7900
11:01:53,524 --> 11:02:00,103
an extremely healthy man of indeterminate middle age with
no supernatural properties whatsoever,

7901
11:02:00,123 --> 11:02:05,945
who owned nothing that anybody could take from him
and had no access to anything that

7902
11:02:05,965 --> 11:02:07,182
