7958
11:06:46,688 --> 11:06:49,806
She used to laugh about it. She laughed
about it for sixty years.

7959
11:06:50,086 --> 11:06:54,160
So I came up the hill to watch him be put in the
ground next to her, and I'll tell you

7960
11:06:54,180 --> 11:06:58,397
